284
00:17:19.679 --> 00:17:20.844
All right, thanks, Jessie.

285
00:17:20.846 --> 00:17:23.346
Becca, oh, very nice.

286
00:17:23.348 --> 00:17:24.648
All right, thanks, Malcolm.

287
00:17:24.650 --> 00:17:26.784
