318
00:19:08.688 --> 00:19:10.621
Fourth seed, Justin.

319
00:19:10.623 --> 00:19:12.355
Fifth seed, Andrew.

320
00:19:12.357 --> 00:19:15.392
Today we are gonna look at
different alkaline metals

321
00:19:15.394 --> 00:19:18.996
