352
00:21:33.932 --> 00:21:35.431
- Greg's class?
- Mm-hmm.

353
00:21:35.433 --> 00:21:38.270
Something with the slides and an explosion.

354
00:21:48.547 --> 00:21:49.746
Hey, Lucas.

355
00:21:49.748 --> 00:21:51.981
