476
00:29:54.232 --> 00:29:55.500
Anybody seen my lunch?

477
00:29:56.401 --> 00:29:58.938
Brown bag. Says "Mr. Butler" on it.

478
00:30:31.036 --> 00:30:34.036
<i>Yeah, I know it'd suck
